sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Host
    participant R as Relay
    participant A as Android
    H->>R: Pair offer hash + signed host metadata
    H-->>A: QR or manual code (2 minute expiry)
    A->>R: Capability + device key + signed nonce
    R->>H: Pending claim
    H->>A: Signed transcript + host nonce
    A->>H: Signed transcript + phrase confirmation
    H->>R: Atomically consume offer
    R-->>A: Host-signed acceptance
